  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advocating for sustainable Integrated Water Resources Management (IWRM) in addressing food and water</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The King Hassan II Great World Water Prize is recognizing FAO s efforts on its work on food security and water security, its application of a holistic approach to IWRM and its works with all stakeholders at all levels from farmers to international sphere. Through this prize, FAO is planning to push forward its FAO Water Journey through strengthening its project support on IWRM, promoting IWRM through various international conferences and fora, as well as through policy support and knowledge sharing activities. (for details see annex)</narrative>
  </description>
